KB909095&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Update: 2008-12-11: Unfortunately, it doesn't always work.  Even after
applying the hotfix, one of my laptops still won't hibernate.&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
